OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FShowers
OL,6,Fgradually fading this evening, a dry
OL,7,Fnight with clear spells to follow. The
OL,8,Fwesterly wind eases in most places to
OL,9,Fa light or gentle breeze. Feeling
OL,10,Fcooler than previous nights.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTuesday:FDry with prolonged sunny
OL,13,Fspells for some places in the morning,
OL,14,Fturning cloudier by the afternoon but
OL,15,Fremaining dry.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
