OL,5,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FCloudy
OL,6,Fand windy on Wednesday with outbreaks
OL,7,Fof rain. Dry with sunny spells on
OL,8,FThursday, with the wind easing.
OL,9,FTurning cloudier with strengthening
OL,10,Fwinds once more on Friday.
